# A drawn game names no winner. With integer komi — a loaded SGF, or the `komi`
# command — an even count was recorded as RE[B+0] and announced as a White win:
# three places each resolved zero to a colour, and not to the same one.
#
# Empty board, komi 0, two passes: the mock scores it 0.

new_game 9
wait_idle
switch_player black human
switch_player white human
wait_idle
komi 0
wait_idle
expect komi 0

pass
wait_until move_count >= 1
pass
wait_until has_result true
wait_idle
expect phase finished
expect msg jigo
expect result jigo
